  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T23:58:55.767773Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T00:11:15.914469Z",
  "totalBlocks": 101,
  "translatedBlocks": 101,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55abf0e7e20bc618",
      "translationZh": "在本系列的第 1 部分中，我们介绍了 Amazon Quick 提示工程的基本原则：明确具体、设定上下文、少样本示例，以及用于复杂请求的 CRISPE 框架。这些原则具有普遍适用性。在本文中，我们将逐一介绍各个组件，展示 Quick 的每项功能如何以不同方式解读提示，以及哪些模式能让各项功能取得最佳结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "816c9c94bf36b22c",
      "translationZh": "你可能会使用 Amazon Quick Research 进行市场分析，使用 Amazon Quick Flows 实现自动化，使用 Amazon Quick Sight 进行数据可视化，使用聊天智能体获取团队知识，或使用操作集成实现跨系统工作流。无论你的目标是什么，以下技巧都能帮助你从泛泛的输出转向精准、可付诸行动的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc1989aaf5dad891",
      "translationZh": "能否从 Amazon Quick Research 获得有用的输出，取决于你如何表述研究目标。智能体会接收你的目标，将其拆解为子主题，在企业数据和外部来源中进行搜索，然后提供一份附有引用的结构化报告。模糊的目标会产生浅显的报告。具体的目标则会产生可据以采取行动的成果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b53a5aefe06f4dbe",
      "translationZh": "明确目标、受众和重点领域",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16f22466089a13f4",
      "translationZh": "AWS 文档直截了当地指出：“明确说明你想实现什么、为谁实现，以及为什么要实现。”一个有力的目标会点明主题、界定时间范围、明确受众，并告诉智能体哪些输出最重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a3a8fd733f17217",
      "translationZh": "这个目标告诉智能体要调查什么、采用什么视角，以及读者关心什么。Quick Research 会利用这些上下文来拟定子问题、选择相关数据源，并围绕你的实际需求组织报告。在撰写目标之前，问问自己：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab8fe2e72473c4b7",
      "translationZh": "这项研究将为哪项决策提供依据？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d64fe29a33bcd373",
      "translationZh": "什么样的成果会让他们说“这正是我需要的”？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6fef8ddc44531d3e",
      "translationZh": "将复杂主题拆解为子问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8baed3dbcef6abdf",
      "translationZh": "Quick Research 会自动将目标拆解为子主题，但如果你自己先做一部分拆解工作，就能获得更好的结果。对于涉及多个方面的研究，请列出你希望得到解答的具体问题。这能为智能体提供更明确的方向，减少它偏离主题的可能性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fad0c4610cf39dae",
      "translationZh": "限定信息来源并审查计划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d05c344ba7ec6d5",
      "translationZh": "Quick Research 通过 Quick Index 获取企业数据，同时利用 200+ 家可信新闻媒体，以及来自 S&P Global、FactSet、IDC、US Patent data 和 PubMed 的优质数据集。输入目标后，选择要纳入哪些来源，并审查研究计划草案。竞争分析不需要 PubMed。临床文献综述不需要新闻文章。缩小信息来源范围能让智能体更专注，并减少噪声。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc6d68bfcad0acc9",
      "translationZh": "一个工作流能为团队节省五分钟还是五小时，往往取决于你如何编写提示词。Quick Flows 会将自然语言描述转化为自动化工作流，但你提供的具体程度、结构和上下文，会直接影响最终得到的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cdd464921d8edfee",
      "translationZh": "明确说明做什么、何时做以及在哪里做",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b240cd2afb0c2d76",
      "translationZh": "模糊的提示词会产生模糊的流程。最常见的错误是只描述你想要什么，却不说明如何做、何时做或为谁做。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0932b0f401a7241d",
      "translationZh": "修改前：“根据我们的销售数据生成一份报告。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce524c0b2c5672e",
      "translationZh": "修改后：“每周一上午 8 点，从 CRM 中提取上一周的销售数据，计算总收入和按售出数量排名的前 10 款产品，生成一页 PDF 摘要，并通过电子邮件发送到 sales-managers 邮件分发列表。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9304a0acf6c4636d",
      "translationZh": "第二个提示词为 Quick Flows 提供了具体的锚点：执行时间、数据源、具体计算、输出格式和发送目标。每个细节都对应生成的流程中的一个步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce3348b0e82dc804",
      "translationZh": "定义触发器时，要明确执行时间和触发条件。“每周一上午 8 点”很清楚。“有新数据到达时”则很模糊。请明确由哪个系统产生触发事件、什么算是“新数据”，以及如果触发器已触发但没有新数据，应如何处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d00b83b5ab40e0af",
      "translationZh": "将复杂逻辑组织成编号步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ca8f147aa67f927",
      "translationZh": "对于包含两三个以上操作的工作流，请将提示词写成带编号的步骤序列。Quick Flows 支持条件分支、重复循环和用户输入，编号步骤可以自然地映射到其内部步骤结构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84a6220693d5a823",
      "translationZh": "这种结构让调试变得简单直接：如果第 3 步不起作用，你就能准确知道该检查哪里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "04b18977b42a69dc",
      "translationZh": "通过对话迭代，而不是重写",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0075ebbb985a91f7",
      "translationZh": "借助 Quick Flows 的智能体运行时，你可以在初次构建完成后通过对话完善流程。不要重写整个提示词，而是使用有针对性的后续指令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a26fc2543175714b",
      "translationZh": "Quick Flows 会保留原始提示词中的上下文，因此后续调整会在已有内容的基础上进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d9eb4add0b435a4",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon Quick Sight，你可以通过对话式查询探索数据。组织分析请求时，应明确业务问题、相关维度、所需计算以及可视化偏好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "30d5d98c097a9831",
      "translationZh": "分析查询的结构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff802340ae27625e",
      "translationZh": "每个有效的 Quick Sight 查询都包含以下核心要素：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3774a0e4af489391",
      "translationZh": "业务问题（你希望做出的决策或获得的洞察）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "564729ef04cd638b",
      "translationZh": "指标（你想要分析的定量度量）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e786253a4919dee",
      "translationZh": "维度（如何对数据进行分组、筛选或细分）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b59f514422bbd360",
      "translationZh": "时间段（相关的时间范围）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af2f8560981dd4d5",
      "translationZh": "可视化类型（最能传达洞察的图表形式）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b83439c594cacd48",
      "translationZh": "附加分析（趋势线、阈值、统计标记或对比时段）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8aa040fdd1ed5f3d",
      "translationZh": "遗漏其中任何一项都会迫使 Quick Sight 进行猜测，这往往会生成技术上正确却没有实用价值的可视化图表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "957b8d6ef57c2c8f",
      "translationZh": "时间序列：“用堆叠折线图，按优先级绘制过去 12 个月的客户支持工单量。添加一条总工单量的趋势线，以便我看出整体工作负荷是在上升还是下降。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70266826bb6f3a68",
      "translationZh": "比较：“比较 2025 年 Q4 各垂直行业和销售代表的平均交易金额。用分组条形图展示，按交易金额降序排列，并突出显示我们平均交易金额低于 50K 的任何垂直行业。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc7b29be0b0386cd",
      "translationZh": "关系：“构建客户生命周期价值与产品使用频率的散点图。按订阅级别为数据点设置不同颜色，并添加一条回归线，以便我看出使用频率对 LTV 的预测能力有多强。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4a5d3bc5125a3f9",
      "translationZh": "分布：“生成过去六个月项目完成耗时的直方图。以两周为一个分箱，将目标完成耗时作为垂直参考线叠加在图上，并特别标出项目占比超过 20% 的任何分箱。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16a918e1ef86dd90",
      "translationZh": "地理：“用热力图展示北美的客户分布。用颜色深浅表示收入集中程度，并为贡献超过总收入 10% 的任何地区添加数据标签。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "99868a6c5026a018",
      "translationZh": "优化可视化并创建计算字段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d988a1a5c19a022",
      "translationZh": "使用 Topics（经过精选整理、针对对话式查询优化的数据集合）时，应围绕业务成果来提出问题，而不是围绕数据操作细节。不要问“给我展示一张用户数量表”，而要问“以日活跃用户数和会话时长衡量，哪些客户群体在我们的移动应用中的参与度最高？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e736bff765eb3fd0",
      "translationZh": "生成初始可视化后，通过后续对话进行优化：更改图表类型、添加筛选条件、修改聚合方式，或请求创建计算字段。用自然语言描述公式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df30b7f2a315741d",
      "translationZh": "“添加一个名为‘Customer Health Score’的计算字段，综合续约概率（权重为 40%）、产品使用趋势（权重为 35%）和支持工单频率（权重为 25%，反向计分——工单越少，健康度越高）。将其显示为 0–100 的指数。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "300a6f120481b80e",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 聊天智能体将对话式 AI 引入你的组织。你可以控制智能体的身份，将其连接到公司的知识库，设置行为护栏，并将其发布给团队使用。体验质量取决于你配置智能体时的周全程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "275727706ca7fc92",
      "translationZh": "定义清晰的智能体身份",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e995338130f77dca",
      "translationZh": "Builder Mode 中的身份字段为每一次回复奠定基础。完善的身份设定会明确角色、界定专业领域，并划定清晰的边界：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "505cf9213126a5b4",
      "translationZh": "如果没有这样的边界，智能体往往会回答超出其专业范围的问题，给出自信却不可靠的回复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33532eb9a80b5e15",
      "translationZh": "随着团队需求的变化，定期审视智能体的身份设定。六个月前编写的身份设定，可能已无法反映当前的优先事项、工具或组织结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fa7af3d68493d81b",
      "translationZh": "连接合适的知识并设置防护边界",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ddefb2510e2fc05",
      "translationZh": "将 Quick Spaces 关联到智能体，决定了它能够从哪些信息中获取依据。要有意识地做出选择：如果智能体连接了组织中的每一个 Quick Space，就会呈现不相关的内容。应让知识来源与智能体所定义的角色相匹配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bb266a3f8daa2c0",
      "translationZh": "同样重要的是，告诉智能体在没有答案时该怎么做。如果没有明确指令，智能体就会用看似合理但实际编造的回答来填补空白：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f9c1c50be6d06a4",
      "translationZh": "定期审查已连接的 Quick Spaces。过时的文档比没有文档更糟，因为智能体会自信地引用它们。随着团队知识的变化，移除陈旧的来源并添加新的来源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e96ac5ddb7ba9a1f",
      "translationZh": "设计能够培养良好习惯的建议提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c688fb308b9060ad",
      "translationZh": "建议提示词是用户首先看到的内容。它们设定预期，并示范智能体发挥最佳表现所需的具体程度。像“问我有关成本的问题”这样模糊的建议，会教用户编写模糊的提示词。具体的建议则能培养更好的习惯：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3b2ddabfea38d0d",
      "translationZh": "“在过去 30 天内，我们的生产账户中哪些 EC2 实例系列的利用率最低？如果对它们进行规格优化，我们能节省多少费用？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5633f2cde9d42d77",
      "translationZh": "“比较将我们的 RDS 按需使用转为 1 年预留计划与转为 3 年节省计划对成本的影响。哪个选项能让我们在节省成本与灵活性之间获得最佳平衡？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c96d7cc0c711675d",
      "translationZh": "借助操作连接器，Quick 可以与 Jira、Slack、Confluence 和 Salesforce 等外部系统交互。有效的操作提示词应包含明确的意图、所有必要参数，以及恰当的执行顺序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9b0294a977951eb",
      "translationZh": "参数指定",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1f155ec958f5bee",
      "translationZh": "预先提供所有必需信息。参数不完整会迫使系统追问或作出假设：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5c2f4dd1df0feed",
      "translationZh": "组织多步骤工作流时，要明确各步骤之间的依赖关系。为步骤编号，指定条件，并明确说明哪个步骤的输出会作为下一步的输入：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ab8a93b56facf1fd",
      "translationZh": "操作审核处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee62f3245d1c76dc",
      "translationZh": "对于破坏性操作或批量操作，应组织好提示词，以支持在执行前进行审核。要求系统先生成摘要报告，然后仅在你明确批准后才执行操作。这对于修改工单、删除记录或向外部利益相关者发送信息的操作尤其重要。将审核步骤直接纳入提示词，而不是仅依赖系统级安全防护措施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cc57da2dfbc4ee98",
      "translationZh": "应避免的常见陷阱",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d0bd30dabb343f8",
      "translationZh": "了解常见错误，有助于你在使用所有 Quick 组件时避免受挫。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ef95b0f5b341804",
      "translationZh": "使用可能产生多种理解的模糊表述。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f6f6a03eeedb6b9a",
      "translationZh": "在单个提示词中塞入过多要求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5e8e5ebc2de82c6",
      "translationZh": "假定 AI 掌握了它实际上并不具备的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b692f0e2f288fba",
      "translationZh": "忽略指定输出格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d69dfba616c2e2a",
      "translationZh": "未使用贴近实际的边界情况进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0cfb6f60a9d4f479",
      "translationZh": "未记录成功的模式以供复用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0736c39c640f2f90",
      "translationZh": "各组件特有的常见陷阱",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcf91a0183ad18a3",
      "translationZh": "Quick Research：编写搜索查询，而不是研究目标。省略受众背景。跳过研究计划审查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25dccc4e9fca5fef",
      "translationZh": "Quick Flows：在单个提示词中塞入过多操作。跳过用户输入定义。忽略错误条件和失败处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8075b048b8485ca0",
      "translationZh": "Quick Sight：使用模糊的指标，未指定聚合方式。缺少时间背景。分组维度不明确。比较含糊，缺少基准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb93ea6be643a03d",
      "translationZh": "聊天智能体：身份定位模糊，未明确专业领域。关联包含过时信息的空间。未提供回退指令。未在 Preview 模式下测试就上线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26dd309d6ebe0694",
      "translationZh": "操作集成：操作请求模糊，缺少必需参数。操作之间的依赖关系不明确。未针对失败或身份验证问题制定预案。跳过破坏性操作的审查步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "77591c4dc27db2b8",
      "translationZh": "将所学付诸实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11ed55785e416a93",
      "translationZh": "采用分阶段的方法，立即开始应用这些技巧：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c1ff45addd6fd34",
      "translationZh": "确定你最常见的三种 Quick 使用场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10abe24366f15a52",
      "translationZh": "使用第 1 部分介绍的 CRISPE 框架重写现有提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b187f3800aeb9433",
      "translationZh": "记录改写前后的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4669ec150ceb2475",
      "translationZh": "第 2 周：聚焦组件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c388d48878947586",
      "translationZh": "选择一个 Quick 组件（Quick Research、Quick Flows、Quick Sight 或 Quick chat agents）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee9de9d1259d200d",
      "translationZh": "将本文中针对特定组件的模式应用到实际工作流中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c75d30ee5283feed",
      "translationZh": "创建可复用的提示词模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c3d9b9324a270f4",
      "translationZh": "第 3 周：进阶技巧",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44a9d196c0f46f2e",
      "translationZh": "在你的知识库中实现元数据驱动的检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27ebcfb88ae3d25c",
      "translationZh": "使用 ARCHITECT 框架构建自定义智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c5b2a03fcf0571d",
      "translationZh": "创建一个包含条件逻辑的复杂 Quick Flow。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e319386c309d0af1",
      "translationZh": "第 4 周：扩展与分享",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb92b416f50471fd",
      "translationZh": "在共享库中记录你最有效的提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3ea96ac46803c22",
      "translationZh": "培训团队成员，让他们掌握成功的模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c9c51867096dcf1",
      "translationZh": "建立反馈机制，以持续改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b102875d644b92a8",
      "translationZh": "每个 Quick 组件都有自己的优势和独特之处，但底层原则始终相同：你越精确地表达意图，输出就越好。Quick Research 需要清晰的目标以及受众背景信息。Quick Flows 需要编号步骤，并明确触发条件和执行条件。Quick Sight 需要结构化查询，并定义指标和维度。智能体需要鲜明的身份和清晰的边界。操作需要完整的参数和恰当的执行顺序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735a7b04d357f1a3",
      "translationZh": "本文和第 1 部分中的提示词模式是起点，而不是僵化的模板。在使用过程中，你会逐渐形成直觉，了解每个组件对什么样的输入响应最好。你会发现，精确的受众定义能让 Quick Research 智能体给出更好的结果，Quick Flows 需要明确的错误处理，Quick Sight 查询在明确指定聚合类型时效果最佳，而聊天智能体在知识范围较窄时表现更好。记录有效的做法，与团队分享，并持续迭代。从 AI 中获益最多的组织，并不是那些拥有最先进技术的组织，而是那些已经学会如何与 AI 有效沟通的组织。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07e4615c205e49b8",
      "translationZh": "准备好继续提升你的提示工程实践了吗？接下来可以这样做：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15b8d46b1a978b2d",
      "translationZh": "阅读第 1 部分——《Amazon Quick 的提示工程基础》涵盖了本文 throughout referenced 的核心原则和 CRISPE 框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2cc690d6ed77359",
      "translationZh": "探索 Amazon Quick——访问 Amazon Quick 服务页面，概览全部功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b564f09c9b02f2da",
      "translationZh": "阅读文档——Amazon Quick 开发者文档详细介绍了提示配置、流程编写和代理设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cddd1f67403fa55",
      "translationZh": "克隆示例代码——GitHub 上的 aws-samples/sample-quicksuite-kiro-quickstarts 代码库包含可用作起点的 Quick API 脚本和模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
